# Pendulum Isle (CIPlay pendulum_isle): a low sky island 12 m up; the top, the hall rules, the weather station (Anja's
# note), Bob Hill's foot and top, Halvard's sighting log (10-25 deep pass), the buried survey bolt, the pendulum frame
# (the generator), the generator room's four plans, the zipline's low end, the shaft warning, the keel (zone keel: the
# plan's done-when, it brings Gravewell Shaft). OLDER4 10-26: the Iron Ridge, its survey and Needle Knoll before the
# zipline (steps 12-14); after the quest the compass garden's lamps and the pilot's five photographs.
island Pendulum Isle
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Keel
zone top
expect step 1
read Pendulum hall rules
expect step 2
read Dr. Anja Roos
expect step 3
zone bobfoot
expect step 4
zone bobtop
expect step 5
read Halvard's sighting
expect step 6
dig
expect story surveybolt 1
expect step 7
use framelever
expect story power 1
expect step 8
open Generator room
wait 3
expect step 12
zone ironridge
expect step 13
read Lodestone survey
expect step 14
zone needlefoot
zone needletop
expect step 15
zone low_end
expect step 16
read Keel shaft warning
expect step 17
use shaft
zone keel
storespot 20 -3
expect done
# OLDER4 10-26 (off the quest): the compass garden's lamps, the pilot's photographs
zone compassgarden
expect hidden pi_lampchest
use Compass lamp north
use Compass lamp south
wait 1
expect shown pi_lampchest
open Compass garden box
expect hidden pi_setchest
use pi_photo1
use pi_photo2
use pi_photo3
use pi_photo4
use pi_photo5
wait 2
expect shown pi_setchest
open Pilot's film case
